<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">ERP Audit, Compliance & Governance</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Rigorous system-level controls and transparency that ensure organizational integrity, 
            protect assets, and simplify complex regulatory compliance.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Immutable Change Transparency</h2>
        <p>
            Experience perfect accountability with an immutable audit log that records every 
            significant interaction within the ERP system. Every record creation, 
            modification, and deletion is captured with a high-resolution timestamp 
            and the responsible user ID. This "persistence of truth" is essential 
            for effective forensic analysis and provides external auditors with the 
            evidence needed for rapid and confident certification.
        </p>
        <p>
            System-level logs capture login attempts, security policy changes, and 
            administrative actions, ensuring that the integrity of the software 
            platform itself is never compromised.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Structural Segregation of Duties (SOD)</h2>
        <p>
            Protect against internal fraud and error with system-enforced segregation of duties. 
            Define rules that prevent a single individual from possessing conflicting 
            capabilities—for example, preventing the same user from both creating a 
            vendor and approving a payment to that vendor. These rules are enforced 
            structurally at the permissions layer, ensuring that organizational 
            governance is built into your daily workflows.
        </p>
        <p>
            SOD conflict reports highlight any instances where permission overrides 
            have been granted, providing management with clear visibility into 
            governance exceptions.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Automated Regulatory Readiness</h2>
        <p>
            Shorten the time required for regulatory reporting with a library of pre-configured 
            compliance exports. Generate ZIMRA-compliant VAT audit files, NSSA and 
            ZIMDEF schedules, and other mandatory filings directly from your 
            transaction data. This automation ensures that your regulatory submissions 
            are always accurate and submitted on time, protecting the organization 
            from penalties and legal risk.
        </p>
        <p>
            Data retention policy enforcement ensures that your records are kept—and 
            eventually disposed of—according to legal and certification requirements, 
            supporting your broader organizational commitment to ISO 27001 standards.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

